<title>POLAND: POLISH KPW CLEARS ROPCZYCE FOR PUBLIC TRADE.</title>
<headline>POLISH KPW CLEARS ROPCZYCE FOR PUBLIC TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has cleared for public trade the initial public offering of fireproof products maker Zaklady Magnezytowe Ropczyce SA, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The firm's 4,105,980 existing shares have also been approved for trade.</p>
<p>			     No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> IPO			 0.4 million-0.5 million	Sept 15-19</p>
<p> Lead Manager:	   Kredyt Bank brokerage</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:	purchase of production equipment</p>
<p> EARNINGS DATA	   1997 forecast	  1996</p>
<p>(in million of PLN)</p>
<p> Net profit:	     7.0		     6.5</p>
<p> Sales:		    na		    101.9</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p>National Investment Fund No. 10 - 33 pct of shares</p>
<p>State Treasury - 25 pct of shares</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
